  "description": "Privacy-first semantic code navigation MCP server using RAG. Features deep AST multi-language support (Go, PHP/Laravel/WP, JS/TS/React, Python), 100% local LLMs (Ollama), and vector search (Qdrant) for AI IDEs like Cursor, Windsurf, Copilot, and Claude.",
